00:12:35.112 --> 00:12:40.372
families describe bread and canned food, and meals from charitable community kitchens.

00:12:41.132 --> 00:12:45.512
Nabiga's mother, Alia, said that after the ceasefire, they are living under a suffocating

00:12:45.512 --> 00:12:49.192
blockade, and she asked that medicines and treatments be allowed in.

00:12:49.892 --> 00:12:54.772
Tahrir Zedan said he has not been able to buy even one kilogram of meat, a chicken,

00:12:54.992 --> 00:12:56.192
or a kilogram of fruit.

